AiTask weekly_high_value_orders_email {
  label: 'Weekly High-Value Orders Email'
  description: 'Emails last week’s individual orders with a pre-discount value of at least $1,500.'

  brief: @md
    1. From @Dataset:ecommerce_official, retrieve every individual order created during the last complete Monday–Sunday week.
    2. Calculate each order’s pre-discount item total as the sum of order item quantity multiplied by product price. Include only orders whose calculated total is at least $1,500.
    3. Write a concise email-ready report that states the exact reporting period and includes a table of all matching orders with order ID, created date, status, and pre-discount total. Format totals as USD. If no orders match, state that explicitly.
    4. Write the result with the write_ai_task_result skill.

    Delivery: After every run, email the completed report to nhi.ty+qa@holistics.io. Record delivery as successful only when the email operation succeeds; otherwise record the actual failure and do not claim delivery.
  ;;

  acceptance_criteria: @md
    - The report covers exactly the last complete Monday–Sunday week.
    - Each listed record is an individual order from @Dataset:ecommerce_official and has a pre-discount item total of at least $1,500, calculated as quantity multiplied by product price and summed at the order level.
    - The report states the reporting period and includes order ID, created date, status, and USD-formatted pre-discount total for every matching order; it explicitly says when none match.
    - The completed report is emailed to nhi.ty+qa@holistics.io after every run, and delivery is marked successful only after the email operation succeeds.
  ;;
}
